=== vec2 chained ops (1)
' Komplexere Ausdruecke -- (v + w) * 2 - v.
IMPORT "vec2"
DIM v AS VEC2
DIM w AS VEC2
v = VEC2_NEW(1.0, 1.0)
w = VEC2_NEW(2.0, 3.0)
PRINT (v + w) * 2.0 - v
--- erwartet
Vec2(5.0, 7.0)

